        <mxCell id="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-5" value="Program Validators" style="swimlane;" parent="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1650" y="70" width="320.08" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-58" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Components:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;PDA :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;- List of addresses of validator that are alowed to vote, AND add proposal.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Functions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- RequestToJoinSystem( address NFT, escrow address)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Vote (signer, vote)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Trust Score function (every time a validator votes, it&#39;s score increases - feature if it&#39;s vote maches with the outcome then it&#39;s vote will increase, if not it&#39;s vote will decrease in % )&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Mint Proposal - with the list of wallets that voted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=default;" parent="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="12.81" y="30" width="300" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j0KfjzD9NSgphTKlZgvb-77" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:6px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ESCROW Proposal - Validators Only&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rules:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- It has an expire date, if by that date there is no resolution reached, the proposal is deneid, an NFT is being minted stating &quot;Expiration Date Reached - NO RESOLUTION&quot;, meaning proposal is rejected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- If resolution is reached approved/denied an NFT get&#39;s generated with Approved or Denied !.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Voting list - containing the wallet addresses and the vote.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- This voting&amp;nbsp; mechanism is public.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" style="align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;dropTarget=0;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="80" width="280" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-47" value="Validators PDA" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;fillColor=default;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1560" y="430" width="270" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-48" value="- list of validators : wallet addresses&lt;div&gt;- ban list : addresses&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-&amp;nbsp; NFT FORM Voting YES/NO&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- score list - each wallet address linked to a score&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- score threshold : with percentage rewords&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=default;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-47" vertex="1">
