        <mxCell id="j0KfjzD9NSgphTKlZgvb-75" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:6px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ESCROW For Joining the System&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rules:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- It has an expire date, if by that date there is no resolution than the amount get&#39;s returned to the owner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- An&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;NFT is being minted stating &quot;Expiration Date Reached - NO RESOLUTION&quot;, meaning the join request is rejected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- If resolution is acheave approved/denied % is sent to the validators treasury account&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- NFT get&#39;s minted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Accounts:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- PDA Vault Account&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Functions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Expire date&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Set Resolution : owner - program account&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Send %&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;SOL to validators treasury account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- Send SOL to the ARK treasury account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- Mint Resolution NFT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- Release amount to the entity that initiated the escrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;dropTarget=0;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="SYBLzuHmYJuErBrczjhj-4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="475" y="80" width="260" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
