        <mxCell id="j0KfjzD9NSgphTKlZgvb-80" value="&lt;div&gt;- Holds the amount that validators need to split&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;based on their %.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Owner Admin Sol&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- List with escrows and amount&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="align=left;strokeColor=none;fillColor=default;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;resizable=0;rotatable=0;part=1;html=1;" parent="j0KfjzD9NSgphTKlZgvb-79" vertex="1">
