        <mxCell id="GEga7pHQwOTUdIS_QKCw-505" value="User story" style="swimlane;" parent="GEga7pHQwOTUdIS_QKCw-520" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1402" y="65" width="610" height="235" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="500" y="450" width="120" height="30" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cvtiSawDCd0xw21VSJTq-9" value="&lt;p&gt;An entity seeking to join the network completes a form with the required information, which is encrypted using Zero-Knowledge Proof (ZK-Proof) technology. The encrypted data is then uploaded to IPFS, and the entity stakes 100 SOL by sending it to the program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A percentage of the staked amount is distributed as a fee to the DAO validators, while the remainder is held in a vault account until the validation process is completed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The veterinary cabinet has up to three attempts to successfully complete the registration. If the registration is rejected, the SOL held in the vault is refunded to the veterinary cabinet. However, the portion of SOL distributed to the DAO treasury as a fee is non-refundable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the registration is approved, the remaining SOL in the vault is transferred to the program&#39;s account wallet. All sensitive data is securely encrypted with ZK-Proof technology and stored on IPFS.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="GEga7pHQwOTUdIS_QKCw-505" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="14" y="25" width="586" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
