        <mxCell id="uNp39jwMSyjZY56uAZcd-3" value="An entity seeking to join the network completes a form with the required information, &#xa;uploads the necessary files to a designated location, and sends an SOL amount to the &#xa;program as a registration fee. The veterinary cabinet has up to three attempts to &#xa;complete the registration.&#xa;Please note that the registration fee is non-refundable. If the veterinary cabinet is &#xa;rejected, it will be blocked from attempting registration for 30 days.&#xa;All sensitive data is encrypted using Zero-Knowledge Proof (ZK-Proof) technology and &#xa;securely uploaded to IPFS." style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;align=left;spacingLeft=6;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="uNp39jwMSyjZY56uAZcd-1">
