        <mxCell id="uNp39jwMSyjZY56uAZcd-36" value="&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;Veterinary cabinet can add an animal to their animal list, it will be added as an PDA where ownership can be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;transferable. I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;t fills in a registration form, veterinary cabinet validate animal documents..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The trust score is being increased for veterinary cabinet every time it adds a new animal in the system.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Sensitive data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;like animal owner details will be&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;encrypted using ZK-Proof Veterinary Cabinet key and sended&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;to IPFS, the data on the blockchain will be&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;encrypted with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;program key. Only the cabinet can read the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;sensitive data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="uNp39jwMSyjZY56uAZcd-35">
