        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Wi551SWM2cRamMvrgl9W-93" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Possible Improvements&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1375&quot; data-start=&quot;1343&quot;&gt;⚠️ &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1375&quot; data-start=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;Possible Improvements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol data-end=&quot;2413&quot; data-start=&quot;1376&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1790&quot; data-start=&quot;1581&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1613&quot; data-start=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1611&quot; data-start=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;Medical Billing / Costs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1790&quot; data-start=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1680&quot; data-start=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1680&quot; data-start=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;You added &lt;code data-end=&quot;1645&quot; data-start=&quot;1629&quot;&gt;procedureCosts&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code data-end=&quot;1666&quot; data-start=&quot;1650&quot;&gt;treatmentCosts&lt;/code&gt; (great 👍).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1790&quot; data-start=&quot;1684&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1790&quot; data-start=&quot;1686&quot;&gt;If you want invoicing, maybe add a &lt;code data-end=&quot;1730&quot; data-start=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;BILLING&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code data-end=&quot;1744&quot; data-start=&quot;1734&quot;&gt;INVOICES&lt;/code&gt; table to centralize payments, discounts, etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1954&quot; data-start=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1825&quot; data-start=&quot;1795&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2217&quot; data-start=&quot;2189&quot;&gt;Audit Logs Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2413&quot; data-start=&quot;2186&quot;&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2413&quot; data-start=&quot;2223&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2275&quot; data-start=&quot;2223&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2275&quot; data-start=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;Currently &lt;code data-end=&quot;2256&quot; data-start=&quot;2235&quot;&gt;AUDIT_LOGS.entityId&lt;/code&gt; is very generic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2413&quot; data-start=&quot;2279&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2413&quot; data-start=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;Might be worth making it polymorphic (&lt;code data-end=&quot;2331&quot; data-start=&quot;2319&quot;&gt;entityType&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-end=&quot;2343&quot; data-start=&quot;2333&quot;&gt;entityId&lt;/code&gt;) so you know whether you’re logging &lt;code data-end=&quot;2386&quot; data-start=&quot;2380&quot;&gt;USER&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-end=&quot;2396&quot; data-start=&quot;2388&quot;&gt;ANIMAL&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-end=&quot;2405&quot; data-start=&quot;2398&quot;&gt;VISIT&lt;/code&gt;, etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1690" y="-1055" width="790" height="255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Wi551SWM2cRamMvrgl9W-94" value="" style="endArrow=classic;startArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=-0.003;entryY=0.086;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;exitX=1.005;exitY=0.214;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="Ku_dHCeT_9K8U9IJu_T0-52" target="Ku_dHCeT_9K8U9IJu_T0-49">
